    "description": "Housed in a distinguished classic building, this light-filled 240 sqm residence marries original high ceilings and refined mouldings with a flawless, high-end contemporary interior, just steps from El Retiro Park.\n\nThe Address: Jerónimos is one of Madrid's most coveted neighbourhoods, beside El Retiro and a short walk from the city's finest museums, galleries and restaurants. The building itself is a grand classic house with a marble entrance hall and concierge service.\n\nThe Salon: A majestic open-plan space where formal dining and an elegant lounge flow together beneath period mouldings. Tall classic windows and balconies with integrated wooden shutters bathe the room in natural light, while concealed speakers deliver high-fidelity sound throughout.\n\nThe Kitchen: A masterpiece in metallic finishes and textured natural stone, anchored by a commanding island made for effortless entertaining and private tastings. Fully panelled premium appliances, a backlit glass wine cabinet and integrated shelving keep the lines pure and seamless with the salon.\n\nStudy-Library: A showpiece workspace with its own classic balcony, soaring ceilings and a bespoke bookcase spanning the entire main wall, the ultimate setting for high-level remote work. A second, fully independent study creates a rare dual-office configuration, ideal for working couples or as a creative studio. A separate laundry room completes the home.\n\nBedrooms and Bathrooms: Serene, generous bedrooms with floor-to-ceiling fitted wardrobes in premium finishes, herringbone floors and abundant natural light. Two sumptuous bathrooms in natural stone and microcement, with brushed-steel fittings and heated towel rails.",
